MERCURY EXPOSURE IN COSMETICS AND HUMAN HEALTH RISK

MAGDALENA BÎRSAN 1#, CĂTĂLINA DANIELA STAN 1*, KONRAD MIELCAREK 2, PATRYK
NOWOKOSKI 2, KATARZYNA SOCHA 2#, MATEI PALIMARICIUC 3, ȘADIYE-IOANA
