            Heavy Metals in Tea and Their Adverse Effects on Mother and Fetal Outcome
 Tazeen Shah1, Farheen Shaikh2*, Shafaq Ansari3, Saima Shaikh4, Benazir Mehar5, Rubina Zareen6
1
    Associate Professor of Physiology, Department of Physiology, Liaquat University of Medical and Health Sciences, Jamshoro,
                                                        Sindh, Pakistan
    2
        Associate Professor of Biochemistry, Department of Biochemistry, Peoples University of Medical and Health Sciences for
                                    Women, Nawabshah, Shaheed Benazir Abad, Sindh, Pakistan
    3
